Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the first few years of AI CPU was a real big lagger right sure you used it for some storage used it for some checkpointing\N在 AI 发展的头几年，CPU 确实是个明显的短板，虽然你用它来做一些存储和检查点操作。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:11.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,used it for pre-processing your data and pre-training but it was pretty light and then\N做数据预处理和预训练，但负载很轻。后来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:15.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,inference was also like the models just weren't good enough to be agentic you couldn't\N推理时也感觉模型还不够好，无法实现代理式行为，你无法让它做到。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:22.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know go step by step by step so there was no there was no capability for a model to go and do actions and string them together so then\N你知道，得一步一步来，所以当时模型还无法自主采取行动并把它们串联起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,it wasn't really it was like it was like you would send a string and it send a string back right simple inference and so there was not much need\N其实它就像你发送一段字符串，它就返回一段字符串，很简单地推理，因此并没有太多需求
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:38.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,for CPUs but then over the last few years or last couple years it's not even like last couple years right you know Q* and OpenAI had that and\N经历了那么多风波，但最终 o1 预览版上线了，我想大概是 15、16 个月前，感觉像是很久以前了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:47.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,they had all that drama but then finally o1 preview launched I want to say like 15 16 months ago feels like much longer ago a long time ago Yeah\N他们之前闹了那么多风波，但最终o1预览版还是上线了，我想大概是15、\N16个月前的事了，感觉像是很久以前的事了，真的很久以前了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:55.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,ages yeah but o1 was the first model sort of there and and we we sort of had a entire flood of models right like before people would do simple\N是的，但 o1 是首个出现的模型，之后我们迎来了大量模型的涌现，就像以前人们只会做简单的事情一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:01:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,things like check the output of the model with regex or something simple just to\N比如用正则表达式之类的简单方法检查模型的输出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:04.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,see if it was doing structured properly doing structured outputs you know for function calling\N看看它有没有正确生成结构化输出，比如用于函数调用，
